WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.071
It was early in the morning and still dark outside.

2
00:00:17.072 --> 00:00:21.053
A garbage truck drove along West Street.

3
00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:24.538
Suddenly bolts of electricity lit up the sky.

4
00:00:24.539 --> 00:00:28.573
Za-wap! Za-wap!

5
00:00:28.574 --> 00:00:31.605
A second later the sky was dark again.

6
00:00:31.606 --> 00:00:35.111
"That was strange," said one garbageman.

7
00:00:35.112 --> 00:00:37.508
"Yeah," said the other man.

8
00:00:37.509 --> 00:00:41.925
"I wonder what . . . Oh no!"

9
00:00:41.926 --> 00:00:45.989
Roar!

10
00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:49.356
"I'm so glad it's Friday," said Jack.

11
00:00:49.357 --> 00:00:53.264
"No school tomorrow!"

12
00:00:53.265 --> 00:00:55.978
Roxy and her friends were walking to school.

13
00:00:55.979 --> 00:00:58.779
Everyone was excited about the weekend.

14
00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:02.330
"We should go to the park tomorrow," said Terrell.

15
00:01:02.331 --> 00:01:05.088
"Great idea," said Roxy.

16
00:01:05.089 --> 00:01:07.246
"Let's ride our bikes there."

17
00:01:07.247 --> 00:01:10.297
"I'll bring a Frisbee," said Jack.

18
00:01:10.298 --> 00:01:15.045
"We can play Frisbee tag."

19
00:01:15.046 --> 00:01:19.865
Mara sighed. "I wish I could go with you," she said.

20
00:01:19.866 --> 00:01:22.543
"But my parents made plans already.

21
00:01:22.544 --> 00:01:26.883
They're taking me to the Metro City Natural History Museum."

22
00:01:26.884 --> 00:01:30.017
"I love that museum," said Terrell.

23
00:01:30.018 --> 00:01:33.663
"It has ancient fossils and cave paintings.

24
00:01:33.664 --> 00:01:37.321
And lots of dinosaur bones!"

25
00:01:37.322 --> 00:01:40.587
"Dinosaurs are awesome," said Jack.

26
00:01:40.588 --> 00:01:43.197
"My favorite is T. rex."

27
00:01:43.198 --> 00:01:45.453
Mara's eyes lit up.

28
00:01:45.454 --> 00:01:48.723
"Hey! Why don't you all come with me?"

29
00:01:48.724 --> 00:01:50.881
"Really?" said Roxy.

30
00:01:50.882 --> 00:01:55.374
"Sure," said Mara. "My parents won't mind."

31
00:01:55.375 --> 00:01:57.419
Roxy and her friends grinned.

32
00:01:57.420 --> 00:02:00.054
"I can't wait!" said Jack.

33
00:02:00.055 --> 00:02:03.032
"Maybe we'll see a T. rex skeleton!"

34
00:02:03.033 --> 00:02:07.609
"I wish we could see real live dinosaurs," said Terrell.

35
00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:11.806
"It's too bad they're extinct."

36
00:02:11.807 --> 00:02:15.889
"You can see live dinosaurs, Terrell," said Roxy.

37
00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:20.154
"You just need to invent a time machine."

38
00:02:20.155 --> 00:02:24.391
"Ha-ha." Terrell pretended to laugh.

39
00:02:24.392 --> 00:02:28.805
But then he looked excited.

40
00:02:28.806 --> 00:02:34.277
"Hey! Maybe Rocket Girl could help us build a time machine!"

41
00:02:34.278 --> 00:02:36.918
Roxy laughed and shook her head.

42
00:02:36.919 --> 00:02:40.184
"Terrell, that's ridiculous.

43
00:02:40.185 --> 00:02:44.253
I doubt Rocket Girl knows how to build a time machine."

44
00:02:44.254 --> 00:02:48.480
Terrell sighed. "You're probably right."

45
00:02:48.481 --> 00:02:52.118
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

46
00:02:52.119 --> 00:02:55.286
"Oh!" she said, looking at her friends.

47
00:02:55.287 --> 00:03:00.470
"I just realized I . . . um . . . forgot my pencil box.

48
00:03:00.471 --> 00:03:03.292
I'll see you at school!"

49
00:03:03.293 --> 00:03:06.876
"Wait!" called Terrell as Roxy hurried away.

50
00:03:06.877 --> 00:03:09.814
"You can borrow one of my pencils!"

51
00:03:09.815 --> 00:03:12.128
But Roxy was already gone.

52
00:03:12.129 --> 00:03:16.684
She went around the corner and made sure nobody was nearby.

53
00:03:16.685 --> 00:03:18.813
She pressed a button on her watch.

54
00:03:18.814 --> 00:03:21.651
Mayor Bloom's face appeared on the screen.

55
00:03:21.652 --> 00:03:23.430
He looked nervous.

56
00:03:23.431 --> 00:03:26.760
"Mayor Bloom, what's wrong?" asked Roxy.

57
00:03:26.761 --> 00:03:30.615
"Metro City needs your help, Rocket Girl," said the mayor.

58
00:03:30.616 --> 00:03:34.755
"Dinosaurs are roaming all over downtown Metro City!"

59
00:03:34.756 --> 00:03:39.206
"But dinosaurs are extinct," said Roxy, confused.

60
00:03:39.207 --> 00:03:42.811
"These dinosaurs aren't!" said the mayor.

61
00:03:42.812 --> 00:03:45.227
"Now please, help!"

62
00:03:45.228 --> 00:03:53.200
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy. "I'm on my way!"
